# Per-device, per-build integrity-audit result. Regenerated by run_suite.py (which runs
# preflight.py before any timing) -- version-controlling it would mean masking cells based on a
# stale device's findings.
preflight_result.json

# Measurement OUTPUT from the new harness. All of it is device- and build-specific: results.db
# holds the raw per-batch measurements, noise_floors.json the across-batch spread measured on one
# device, and the *_state.json files are resume points for an interrupted sweep. Committing them
# would let a claim be gated on some other device's noise, or a sweep resume onto results from a
# different libMNN_CL.so -- both silent, both exactly the class of error this harness exists to
# prevent. Regenerate with variance_probe.py / full_sweep.py.
results.db
noise_floors.json
full_sweep_state.json
two_stage_state.json
two_stage_validation.json
